# RULE 29 — CURSOR = CLAUDE SHIP PARITY (owner 2026-08-02; extended 2026-08-03)

**Why:** Cursor PRs repeatedly failed `build-typecheck` / CodeQL while Claude's passed. Not bad luck. Cursor agents put Rule 16 in the **PR body**, used `git commit --no-verify`, skipped husky on bare/worktree clones, and learned lane bands / CLAIMED / EntityLink / **§7 nonfinancial palette** / **auth rateLimit** **after** CI burned 15–20 minutes. Claude writes **one complete commit** and runs the fail-fast gate **before** the first push.

**Owner 2026-08-03:** stop babysitting CI. Build → run local gate → push once. If CI fails, Jorge will say so.

## Mechanical tooth

`scripts/money-pr-local-gate.mjs` (first husky `branch:precheck-push` step) now runs **all** of:

1. `verify-definition-of-done-evidence` (every branch commit — labelled Rule 16 lines)
2. `verify-no-money-theater` (FINDING / LANE / DOD-A…E / VERIFY-1…8 / MODULE_PROGRESS / `MIGRATE:` when migrations touch)
3. `verify-no-parallel-scoreboard-prs`
4. `verify-section7-palette-financial`
5. `verify-section7-palette-nonfinancial` — **Cursor #4198** amber/emerald thrash
6. `verify-new-auth-routes-rate-limited` — **Cursor #4198** CodeQL `js/missing-rate-limiting`
7. `verify-migration-lane-band` — Cursor migrations **HH 12–23 only** (never `…0000` morning)
8. `verify-verify-step-lane-band` — Cursor verify-steps **EVEN only**
9. `verify-no-claimed-numbers-edits` — **never** edit `CLAIMED-NUMBERS.json` on a feature PR
10. `verify-data-migrations-rehearsed` — data-mutating migrations need a `REHEARSED:` line
11. `verify-entity-link-adoption` — bare UUID renders / baseline drift on frontend TSX
12. `verify-no-guard-file-deletion` — **Rule 30** — never soft-reset onto newer main
13. `verify-claude-green-evidence-shape` — **Rule 30** — tip LIVE PROOF is Claude-green

CI verify-steps **1324 + 1430 + 1702 + 1998 + 2088 + 2214** remain the remote backstop. Local gate is the **primary** time-saver.

**Before every `gh pr create`:**  
`node scripts/ops/cursor-ship-preflight.mjs --body-file /tmp/pr-body.txt`  
(runs money-pr-local-gate + cursor-pr-body-gate — Claude's model).

## HARD agent law (non-negotiable)

| Always | Never |
|--------|-------|
| **One commit** over `origin/main` with the full labelled template in the **commit message** | Multi-commit "code then evidence" / prose-only first commit |
| Run `node scripts/money-pr-local-gate.mjs` and require **PASS** before every push | Assume husky ran; push then watch CI |
| Run `cursor-ship-preflight` (or body-gate) before `gh pr create` | Open a PR then fix Rule 16 / CodeQL / palette from CI logs |
| Keep git hooks enabled | `git commit --no-verify`, `git push --no-verify`, `HUSKY=0` |
| Cursor: migration `YYYYMMDDHHMM` with **HH 12–23**; verify-step **EVEN**; no CLAIMED json edit | HH 00–11, odd step numbers, CLAIMED-NUMBERS thrash |
| New/changed auth Fastify routes: `{ config: { rateLimit: { max, timeWindow } } }` | Auth route without rateLimit (CodeQL high) |
| Nonfinancial UI: §7 slate tokens only (no net-new amber/emerald/yellow status classes) | Palette ratchet surprise on build-typecheck |
| Fix EntityLink / regen baseline **in the same commit** when TSX changes fingerprint | Ignore until CI fails |
| **One push** after local PASS; stop. Jorge reports CI fails | Babysit / poll / rebase while CI runs |

## Commit message minimum (every app/db commit)

```
ROOT CAUSE: …
FIX: …
GUARD: scripts/verify-<name>.mjs + scripts/verify-steps/NNNN-verify-<name>.mjs
LIVE PROOF: …   OR   UNVERIFIED — <blocker>
REMAINING: …
```

Money paths also need FINDING / LANE / DOD-A…E / VERIFY-1…8 / MODULE_PROGRESS / MIGRATE (see Rule 23 / DoD §10).

## Autoload / deletion

Deleting this rule, shrinking `money-pr-local-gate` (dropping nonfinancial palette or auth rateLimit), or removing verify-steps **1998 / 2214** fails CI.

